  "promotion": {
    "state": "approved",
    "reason": "Approved by the owner. Qualified as offered on 2026-09-12: a real install of Wekan v11.72, upstream's current release proved it starts, opens to a first screen with a clear next step, survives a restart and a keep-data reinstall with its data intact, and removes everything it created. The definition comes from Runtipi's app store."
