  "data_storage": "Local Store managed folder / wekan",
  "risk_notes": [
    "Creates 2 Docker containers and publishes one port on this computer's loopback interface only.",
    "Keeps its data in this app's managed folder. A keep-data uninstall leaves it; deleting data removes it permanently.",
    "Proven on Windows with Docker's Linux engine. macOS and Linux hosts are unverified.",
    "Asks you to register the first account; anyone who can reach the address can register another.",
    "Boards live in a MongoDB beside it, in the app's folder.",
    "The mail settings are optional: without them Wekan works, but it cannot send board invitations."
  ],
